<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-CZECHS BEAT GERMANY 3-2 IN FED CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CZECHS BEAT GERMANY 3-2 IN FED CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>MANNHEIM, Germany 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech Republic</p>
<p>beat Germany 3-2 in a Fed Cup tennis World Group one tie, after</p>
<p>they won their second reverse singles on Sunday, despite losing</p>
<p>their doubles:</p>
<p>Results (German names first):</p>
<p>Played on Sunday:</p>
<p>Barbara Rittner/Elena Wagner beat Eva Martincova/Ludmila</p>
<p>Richterova 7-6 6-2</p>
<p>Rittner lost to Richterova 1-6 4-6</p>
<p>Marlene Weingaertner lost to Adriana Gersi 2-6 2-6</p>
<p>Played on Saturday:</p>
<p>Weingaertner beat Richterova 3-6 7-5 6-3</p>
<p>Rittner lost to Adriana Gersi 4-6 2-6</p>
</text>
